WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.260
hypertension, and obesity.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.880
And it's a very busy clinic.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:10.860
I see around 80 patients a day and
sometimes more than 90.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:18.196
So conversations about change are not
separate intervention for

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:23.960
me. They are part of ordinary clinical
care every day.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:31.640
So eating, activity, medication, sleep,
stress, work,

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:38.440
and motivational intervention has become
so important in my practice.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:46.076
I first came across MI when I was working
in diabetes and

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:47.660
metabolites department.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:54.180
And I work in outpatient clinic at the
university hospital.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:01:01.630
At that time, I thought that if patients
did not change their lifestyle,

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:08.780
maybe they simply did not have enough
medical knowledge.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:12.500
So I tried very hard to explain.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:18.780
I talked about diabetes and its
complications and risks.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.080
And I asked many questions.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:26.200
And also, I tried to listen very
carefully, too.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:33.340
So from my point of view, I was, I
supposed to be a good doctor.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:39.800
But sometimes I spent more than 30 minutes
with one patient.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:47.106
So even we often had good relationships,
many people still

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.010
did not make changes.

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:52.430
And my clinics ran late.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.940
Then I became exhausted.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:00.290
So at that point, at some point, then

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:06.770
I started to think, maybe the problem is
not the patient.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:10.550
Maybe I need a better way to communicate.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:13.050
So I need to change something.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.710
I talk with my patients.

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:23.010
So I started to find communication method,
which supports

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:26.780
behavior change more efficiently and
effectively.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.676
And finally, I lot more on them.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:30.600
So even my patients are doing a lot of
things, I think, maybe the family
